  advance inclusive excellence across the enterprise.\n    \nFacilitated b
 y: <strong>Elizabeth Jones\, Ph.D.</strong>\, Director for Education and 
 Outreach &amp\; <strong>Genevieve Barnes</strong>\, <strong>M.S. M.A</str
 ong>. Assistant Director for Education and Outreach\n\n        <strong>Th
 ursday\, June 4\, 2026 | 2:00 PM - 3:00 PM | </strong><a href="https://du
 ke.zoom.us/meeting/register/N_HJdagxREy0FKIK4xnGVw#/registration"><strong
 >REGISTER HERE (Zoom)</strong></a>\n</p>
