  Heidi
X-BEDEWORK-COST:Sliding scale of $10 / $20 / $30 (discounts do not apply)
CREATED:20260501T151441Z
DESCRIPTION:Program: Schachmatt\, Coalescence\, Incense Burning on a Satur
 day Morning: The Maestro\nRunning time: 60 minutes\, no intermission\nTic
 kets: Sliding scale of $10 / $20 / $30\nExperience this ADF performance a
 t your own price. Recommended ticket purchase amount is $20. Pay it Forwa
 rd: We welcome additional donations with your ticket purchase to help mak
 e it possible for others to attend this performance where cost may be a b
 arrier.\n\nTickets are purchased through Duke University's Box Office. Ti
 cket packages & discounts do not apply.\n\nArtist website: www.bodytraffi
 c.com\n\nBODYTRAFFIC Unplugged puts the spotlight on the company's extrao
 rdinary dancers and the power of the choreography itself. Featuring three
  works from their repertory\, performed in rehearsal clothes with minimal
  lighting and no sets-no fuss\, just dance-this intimate program is the c
 ompany's electrifying final bow. In 2007\, Tina Finkelman Berkett founded
  the company in Los Angeles\, driven by a commitment to elevate contempor
 ary dance. Under her leadership\, BODYTRAFFIC has become a beacon in the 
 global dance community\, known for its innovative choreography\, world-cl
 ass dancers\, and powerful performances. Through her curation and vision\
 , she has captivated and inspired audiences around the world. We are thri
 lled to have the company back at ADF to celebrate its final season and be
  part of its final Tour of Thanks.\n\nPhoto credit: Guzman Rosado
DURATION:PT1H
DTSTAMP:20260501T154225Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260608T190000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260501T154225Z
